# SOUNDINGS: one XP bar for all three; each level raises HP and the blows'
# strength. A level gained on a dive raises the most HP but heals nothing.
# Old blood in a hand is a level more, bitters a level less; level 16 is the
# top (2,500 HP) and old blood does nothing there.
game soundings
wait 30
press A
wait 20
cheat xp 50
expect level == 2
expect hp0 == 500
expect maxhp0 == 640
cheat xp 100
expect level == 3
cheat equip 0 1 36
expect dlevel0 == 4
expect maxhp0 == 920
cheat equip 1 1 32
expect dlevel1 == 2
cheat surface
expect hp0 == 920
expect hp1 == 640
expect hp2 == 780
cheat xp 400000
expect level == 16
expect dlevel0 == 16
expect maxhp0 == 2500
expect maxhp2 == 2500
expect dlevel1 == 15
